{"w":2400,"lines":[{"y":0.060881735232255485,"t":"Sample Writing answers","h":0.0176066371258361,"x":0.08650519180112691,"w":0.20242214202880859,"c":1},{"w":0.30795847574869789,"x":0.086505191105389845,"t":"TEST 3, WRITING TASK 2","y":0.10741777515710704,"c":1,"h":0.024849666758297806},{"t":"This is an answer written by a candidate who achieved a Band 7.5 score.","x":0.0865051971270763,"y":0.14680232529753512,"w":0.6020761108398438,"h":0.01744186102384615,"c":1},{"y":0.17587209305184248,"t":"As the number of educated people is continually growing, universities attempt to make","h":0.019019439222096812,"x":0.086505201403758086,"w":0.71107264200846354,"c":1},{"c":1,"w":0.67301035563151035,"x":0.086505202392366087,"t":"the process of studying (and it's result) as efficient as possible. Among the ideas to","y":0.19622093023581144,"h":0.018964513854766829},{"w":0.68858133951822909,"c":1,"x":0.084775074121238372,"y":0.21798460469221537,"t":"improve the conditions of students are the thoughts that all undergraduate courses","h":0.017494751574527623},{"w":0.67301035563151046,"h":0.017589345522240563,"t":"should include a period of time spent studying abroad or doing a work placement.","y":0.23967809661500172,"x":0.086505202710309231,"c":1},{"w":0.69550170898437502,"t":"A number of higher education establishments have already implemented these ideas","x":0.086505200781475278,"h":0.01744186102384615,"c":1,"y":0.26889534855557329},{"y":0.28924418571456556,"x":0.084775077176843378,"t":"into life. However, this is the advantage of developed contries, whose economy allows","h":0.02041291690022895,"w":0.69723185221354167,"c":1},{"y":0.31104651184149523,"x":0.086505189894535164,"t":"them spent money on this aspect.","w":0.28027681986490888,"h":0.017504922988282989,"c":1},{"w":0.45155710856119791,"y":0.34009797077581339,"h":0.017494751574527734,"c":1,"x":0.086505182657486968,"t":"Unfortunately, Ukraine is not among their number. Yet."},{"x":0.08817714138296831,"w":0.66794001261393232,"h":0.02073811183366181,"c":1,"y":0.36721705057758114,"t":"Weighing up the pluses and minuses of such strategies one can't but mention that"},{"x":0.088235293113540655,"h":0.017597482786719243,"w":0.69204152425130216,"t":"advantages prevail. Firstly, going abroad, a student gets the opportunity to compare","y":0.39083275004754325,"c":1},{"y":0.41133720933010831,"w":0.65916956583658859,"t":"the approaches and levels of education. Moreover, undergraduates, who are still","h":0.019033679601777487,"c":1,"x":0.086505182419672533},{"h":0.018924845941755697,"y":0.43313953491185453,"c":1,"x":0.088235284963127186,"t":"polishing their skills, have the chance to practice them in the completely new","w":0.62802769978841144},{"x":0.088235287450542987,"y":0.45346396068482564,"t":"environment and probably see new horizons of their future career. In addition to the","w":0.69031143188476562,"h":0.017494751574527734,"c":1},{"w":0.59874196370442712,"h":0.021771003851279946,"c":1,"t":"above mentioned reasons, let us consider the fact of cultural enrichment.","x":0.088161470603259226,"y":0.47318517376391944},{"c":1,"y":0.50169043146968262,"x":0.088173391896188391,"w":0.67831639607747407,"t":"What concerns doing a work placement most of us will agree with the opinion, that","h":0.021721396102531543},{"c":1,"t":"theory and practice are two polar sides of any job. The possibility to try yourself in","h":0.019027576486575493,"x":0.088235295096812466,"y":0.52470930235375901,"w":0.66955017089843749},{"y":0.5465116276247145,"x":0.086505183015717843,"h":0.017519163367963442,"c":1,"t":"several work positions or even fields gives mostly advantages, allowing students to","w":0.67474049886067711},{"h":0.018925863016394096,"y":0.56682995090022181,"w":0.67301035563151035,"x":0.088235306630931945,"c":1,"t":"fit themselves into the real profession, opposing to those which are so wonderfully"},{"y":0.58712386251183424,"t":"depicted in films and books. Moreover, a lot of people spend their whole life doing a job","w":0.70761245727539057,"c":1,"h":0.018980788383724079,"x":0.088235297897771736},{"c":1,"w":0.68521835327148439,"x":0.088192982432827971,"t":"they do not really enjoy. So, why spend time on something you are not that good at?","y":0.60892079611714367,"h":0.020092054544586402},{"y":0.63808139501834893,"x":0.088235283004343232,"w":0.71972320556640623,"h":0.02042105416470763,"c":1,"t":"There are definitely the drawbacks of such ideas, one of them being economical inability"},{"x":0.088235289981640416,"h":0.017513060252761559,"y":0.65988372064854817,"w":0.68339101155598958,"c":1,"t":"of education system to provide such courses for undergraduates in ALL universities."},{"y":0.67987286869401564,"c":1,"t":"However, the fact that developed countries are already moving forward in that","x":0.088183173341584223,"w":0.64717402140299485,"h":0.02091748802873783},{"w":0.71107264200846354,"c":1,"t":"direction gives us hope that in short or long time this strategy will become wide spread","y":0.70188943308910634,"x":0.088235305255893667,"h":0.017587311372963876},{"h":0.019043851015532742,"t":"and even will be taken by us as granted. After all, what to invest money in if not in young","x":0.088235309626804315,"w":0.71972315470377612,"c":1,"y":0.72238372091154857},{"t":"people, the future of humanity.","x":0.088052638800479074,"y":0.74293341841948846,"h":0.0220678982157404,"w":0.25807868957519531,"c":1},{"h":0.014534884186538477,"c":1,"w":0.27162630716959635,"t":"Here is the examiner's comment:","x":0.08823528918902071,"y":0.78197674394604699},{"h":0.017512043178123271,"w":0.64013839721679688,"t":"This is a strong, detailed and well-developed response. Ideas are appropriate","x":0.1280276871148241,"c":1,"y":0.80370888733133627},{"t":"and the position is presented at the beginning of the 4th paragraph [advantages","x":0.12802767692278327,"h":0.018912640378723755,"c":1,"y":0.82120363865638335,"w":0.66782007853190106},{"c":1,"t":"prevail]. The first three paragraphs act as the introduction. Paragraph 4 addresses","h":0.017494751574527734,"y":0.84009797077679793,"w":0.674740498860677,"x":0.12975777816753739},{"y":0.85755813932973246,"w":0.59861592610677083,"c":1,"t":"the advantages of time spent studying abroad (which include comparing","h":0.01892891424030918,"x":0.12802768387568023},{"w":0.67647059122721354,"x":0.1280276801046952,"y":0.87645348839975945,"t":"approaches and levels of education, practising skills in a new environment, seeing","h":0.018927897165670782,"c":1},{"x":0.12802768518046237,"h":0.017527299965070298,"w":0.66262975056966145,"c":1,"y":0.89534883692729472,"t":"new horizons for future careers and cultural enrichment). Paragraph 5 addresses"},{"y":0.91279069769731447,"c":1,"t":"the advantages of doing a work placement (which include trying work positions","h":0.018979771309085791,"x":0.12802769361664465,"w":0.65743942260742183},{"y":0.95930232528252357,"h":0.014534884186538477,"w":0.031141869227091473,"c":1,"t":"134","x":0.089965397519200421}],"h":2857}